---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <header class="page-heading"><h1>A little about me<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>Engineering is a big part of my life. It isn’t the whole story.</p></header>
  <div class="about-content"><p class="lead">I’m Rheza, a Principal Software Engineer working in Grab’s Payments Tech Family.</p><p>Over more than 12 years, my work has taken me through payment platforms, healthcare, digital banking, e-commerce, and enterprise software. I’ve worked on the Grab and OVO payment ecosystem, led a remote engineering team at PRIXA.AI, and helped build digital banking products at BRI and Jenius.</p><p>My background combines engineering with international business. I’m interested in the choices that make systems reliable, secure, and sustainable, and in connecting those choices to the people and businesses they serve.</p><p>This site brings together my professional work and a place to write about life, technology, and religion. I’ll add to it as I go.</p></div>
  <section class="about-links" aria-labelledby="connect-heading"><h2 id="connect-heading">Find me elsewhere</h2><a href={profile.github}><div><strong>GitHub</strong><span>Code, experiments, and open source</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={profile.medium}><div><strong>Medium</strong><span>My writing on Medium</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}><div><strong>Email</strong><span>{profile.email}</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/rheza-satria-cv.pdf" download><div><strong>Curriculum vitae</strong><span>Professional experience and background · PDF</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></section>
</Layout>
